<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 840)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Share &#9656; Join a Review&#8230;</b> is the one place to join: paste the link you were sent, pick a review on your network, or open an invite file.</li>
<li><b>Share This Review</b> opens straight into hosting, with the rarely-needed choices under <b>Options</b>.</li>
<li>The guide follows.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
